### ==========================================
### 6: AUTENTICAÇÃO E AUTORIZAÇÃO (401 / 403)
### ==========================================

### 7. POST Sem token (401 Unauthorized)
POST {{baseUrl}}/predefined-pizzas
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{pizzaProductId}}",
  "sizeIds": ["{{sizeSmall}}"],
  "componentIds": ["{{dough}}", "{{sauce}}", "{{cheese}}"]
}

?? status == 401

### 7.1 POST Como Employee (403 Forbidden)
POST {{baseUrl}}/predefined-pizzas
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "productId": "{{pizzaProductId}}",
  "sizeIds": ["{{sizeSmall}}"],
  "componentIds": ["{{dough}}", "{{sauce}}", "{{cheese}}"]
}

?? status == 403

### 7.2 PUT Como Employee (403 Forbidden)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/predefined-pizzas/{{pizzaId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{employeeToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "isActive": false
}

?? status == 403